                        fields)
  --json                emit a structured envelope
  --dry-run             show the delta without advancing the cursor
  --reset               discard saved cursor first
  --no-status           opt out of grep-style codes: exit 0 on success
                        (changed or not), 2 on error
  --prune               drop cursors whose source file is gone
  --validate            JSONL integrity scan of the whole file (0 clean / 3
                        corrupt / 2 error); no delta, no cursor advance
  --project             fold the ledger to its latest entry per id; entries
